Author: Minecraft 3D mod team

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 3
    Revision: 3

Targets: # Low title IDs this plugin is compatible with
    - 0x001B8700   # Minecraft: New Nintendo 3DS Edition (USA)

Title: Minecraft 3D mod

Summary: Stereoscopic 3D and a performance profiler for Minecraft NN3DS (USA)

Description: |
  Minecraft 3D mod v0.3.3
  Stereoscopic 3D: on v1.0 the game's built-in (unused) right-eye
  renderer; on update v9.12.0 Comfort 3D (both eyes drawn in the
  same frame, 30 fps), alternate eyes or a flat plane. Render
  distance and fast-leaves options, an A/B button swap. Plus a
  performance profiler.
  The plugin verifies the game code against its address tables
  and stays idle on any build it does not know.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
